# Root .dockerignore — applies to every service in docker-compose.yml whose
# build context is "." (zkd-app, zkd-execute). Keeps host-built artifacts and
# unrelated sibling projects out of every image.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.state
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/test-results
.git
.claude
zkd-android
zkd-launcher
zkd-sites
zkd-website
amex-travel-disruption-concierge
Code
zkd-risk-model
